# elprimo

--- Luchador_Grab | gadget | TID_LUCHADOR_BUDDY_GADGET_1_DESC
raw  El Primo dashes, grabbing any enemies hit and suplexing them behind him. El Primo slams enemies into the ground, dealing  <!areaeffect[LuchadorThrowLandingDamageAreaEffect].damage.scaleStatToLevel> area damage.
now  El Primo dashes, grabbing any enemies hit and suplexing them behind him. El Primo slams enemies into the ground, dealing  <!areaeffect[LuchadorThrowLandingDamageAreaEffect].damage.scaleStatToLevel> area damage.
  areaeffect[LuchadorThrowLandingDamageAreaEffect].damage.scaleStatToLevel  -  -> 1000

