--- Luchador_Meteor | gadget | TID_ACCESSORY_LUCHADOR_METEOR_DESC
raw  El primo flexes his pecs and destroys any incoming projectiles for <!card.accessory.areaeffect.timems.msasseconds> sec.
now  El primo flexes his pecs and destroys any incoming projectiles for 1 sec.
  card.accessory.areaeffect.timems.msasseconds  1  -> 1

--- Luchador_Meteor | gadget | TID_LUCHADOR_BUDDY_GADGET_2_DESC
raw  El primo flexes his pecs and destroys any incoming projectiles for <!buddy.accessory.areaeffect.timems.msasseconds> sec. Any projectiles destroyed also charge El Primo's Super!
now  El primo flexes his pecs and destroys any incoming projectiles for 1 sec. Any projectiles destroyed also charge El Primo's Super!
  buddy.accessory.areaeffect.timems.msasseconds  1  -> 1

--- Luchador_overcharge | hypercharge | TID_LUCHADOR_BUDDY_OVERCHARGE_DESC
raw  Leaping high, El Primo drops an Intergalactic Elbow that brings enemies to the Epicenter. Main attacks are bigger and light enemies on fire for <!card.character.weaponskill.overchargedversion.projectile.statuseffectenemy.duration.ticksasseconds> sec.
now  Leaping high, El Primo drops an Intergalactic Elbow that brings enemies to the Epicenter. Main attacks are bigger and light enemies on fire for <!card.character.weaponskill.overchargedversion.projectile.statuseffectenemy.duration.ticksasseconds> sec.
  card.character.weaponskill.overchargedversion.projectile.statuseffectenemy.duration.ticksasseconds  -  -> 2

--- Luchador_overcharge | hypercharge | TID_LUCHADOR_BUDDY_OVERCHARGE_DIFF
