--- Luchador_unique | star power | TID_SPEC_ABI_FIRE_DOT_ULTI_DESC
raw  Enemies caught in El Primo's Super will burn for <VALUE1> damage over 4 seconds.
now  Enemies caught in El Primo's Super will burn for <VALUE1> damage over 4 seconds.
  VALUE1  -  -> 450

--- Luchador_unique | star power | TID_LUCHADOR_BUDDY_STARPOWER_1_DESC
raw  Enemies caught in El Primo's Super will burn for <!card.statusEffect.damage.scaleStatToLevel> damage over <!card.statusEffect.duration.ticksAsSeconds> sec. Punching a burning enemy extends the burn for <!buddy.component[0].values[0].ticksAsSeconds> sec.
now  Enemies caught in El Primo's Super will burn for 450 damage over 4 sec. Punching a burning enemy extends the burn for 4 sec.
  card.statusEffect.damage.scaleStatToLevel  450  -> 450
  card.statusEffect.duration.ticksAsSeconds  4  -> 4
  buddy.component[0].values[0].ticksAsSeconds  4  -> 4

--- Luchador_unique | star power | TID_LUCHADOR_BUDDY_STARPOWER_1_DIFF
raw  Punching a burning enemy extends the burn for <!buddy.component[0].values[0].ticksAsSeconds> sec.
now  Punching a burning enemy extends the burn for 4 sec.
  buddy.component[0].values[0].ticksAsSeconds  4  -> 4

--- Luchador_unique_2 | star power | TID_SPEC_ABI_SPEED_AFTER_ULTI_DESC
raw  El Primo gains a <!card.statuseffect.baseSpeedIncreasePercent>% speed boost for <!card.statuseffect.duration.ticksasseconds> seconds after using his Super.
now  El Primo gains a 25% speed boost for 4 seconds after using his Super.
  card.statuseffect.baseSpeedIncreasePercent  25  -> 25
  card.statuseffect.duration.ticksasseconds  4  -> 3

--- Luchador_unique_2 | star power | TID_LUCHADOR_BUDDY_STARPOWER_2_DESC
raw  El Primo gains a <!card.character.component[0].statuseffect[0].baseSpeedIncreasePercent>% speed boost for <!card.character.component[0].statuseffect[0].duration.ticksasseconds> sec after using his Super.\nHe also gets a <!card.character.component[0].statuseffect[1].shieldpercent>% shield.
now  El Primo gains a 25% speed boost for 4 sec after using his Super.\nHe also gets a 20% shield.
  card.character.component[0].statuseffect[0].baseSpeedIncreasePercent  25  -> 25
  card.character.component[0].statuseffect[0].duration.ticksasseconds  4  -> 3
  card.character.component[0].statuseffect[1].shieldpercent  20  -> 15

--- Luchador_unique_2 | star power | TID_LUCHADOR_BUDDY_STARPOWER_2_DIFF
raw  The speed boost also grants a <!card.character.component[0].statuseffect[1].shieldpercent>% shield!
now  The speed boost also grants a 20% shield!
  card.character.component[0].statuseffect[1].shieldpercent  20  -> 15
